OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome
OL,6,Fsunshine to end the day in the east,
OL,7,Fthough cloudier further west, and
OL,8,Fcloud generally feeding across the
OL,9,Fcountry from the northwest overnight.
OL,10,FThis will bring some patchy rain or
OL,11,Fshowers through the night. Mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FThursday will start rather
OL,14,Fcloudy with the odd spot of rain.
OL,15,FSkies will brighten from the northwest
OL,16,Fleaving a mostly fine afternoon.
OL,17,FFeeling much fresher in gentle
OL,18,Fnorthwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
