OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFriday
OL,6,Fand the weekend will hold onto a
OL,7,Ffresher feel. There will be a lot of
OL,8,Fdry weather with some sunny spells,
OL,9,Fthough isolated showers are also
OL,10,Fpossible.
